(CP-450 Pump Manual \(fictional excerpt\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(FICTIONAL DOCUMENT written for the smart-glasses demo. The CP-450 pump and every number) Tj T*
(   here are made up. Do not use for real equipment.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Section 4: Operating limits) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Normal discharge pressure is 55-70 PSI.) Tj T*
(Read the pressure on the discharge gauge with the pump running for at least 2 minutes.) Tj T*
(Below 50 PSI: check the suction strainer for a clog and look for air leaks on the) Tj T*
(   suction side.) Tj T*
(Above 75 PSI: stop the pump and check that the discharge valve is fully open.) Tj T*
(Maximum casing temperature is 80 C. A hot casing with low flow means the pump may be) Tj T*
(   running dry.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
